From 35395507204d43a232ccd3398176bb2c9a3e3f86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:16:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 42/42] LightsService: restore the hidl light hal fallback

android 17 dropped the hidl light@2.0 path from LightsService and only
talks to the aidl ILights hal. vendors older than android 11 only ship
light@2.0, so no lights get populated and the backlight never changes.
bring back the android 16 hidl fallback and its jni, registered lazily
like the other restored hidl services.
